IMPORT prelude
DECLARE P HAS
    `mínimo` IS A NUMBER
    `máximo` IS A NUMBER
GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
a `excede` b MEANS a GREATER THAN b

GIVEN q IS A NUMBER
      pc IS A P
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`sem not` q pc MEANS
        (pc's `mínimo` `excede` q)
    AND (q `excede` pc's `máximo`)

GIVEN q IS A NUMBER
      pc IS A P
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`uma linha` q pc MEANS pc's `mínimo` `excede` q

#ASSERT NOT `sem not` 3 (P WITH `mínimo` IS 1, `máximo` IS 6)
#ASSERT NOT `uma linha` 3 (P WITH `mínimo` IS 1, `máximo` IS 6)
